- How would you optimize space to O(nmK) memory or better, and what would be the trade-offs for reconstruction?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests advanced DP design with non-trivial subproblem reuse: rewards depend on internal best subarrays, not overall sums.

## Key Concepts
- Contiguous partition DP with non-linear block value
- Precomputation of best subarray sums per interval
- Reconstruction via backpointers

